# Copy to .env.local for local development, and set both in the Vercel
# dashboard (Settings -> Environment Variables) for all environments.
#
# Neither value is a secret. Both endpoints are designed for public HTML form
# posts, which is why no API key ships in the bundle.

# Kit (ConvertKit) form ID — the numeric id in the URL when editing a form:
#   https://app.kit.com/forms/designers/1234567/edit
#                                       ^^^^^^^
VITE_KIT_FORM_ID=

# Formspree form ID — the 8-character hash in your endpoint:
#   https://formspree.io/f/xyzabcde
#                          ^^^^^^^^
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
